      "description": "Nusakambangan Island is an island in the city of Cilacap, which is often associated with terrible prison facilities, but actually Nusakambangan also has beautiful places, one of which is the southern island of Nusakambangan, there are many beaches and the situation is still very beautiful because it is a natural reserve protected, and the photo is the beginning of the beauty of the place.",
